Subject: [PATCH 1/3] ADD reviewed-feature closure confirmation so clean patch
 work can close

After clean review, the controller asks the patch agent for a local done confirmation. Accepting closes the terminal row through close/reopen notices, while later messages reopen the agent so work can continue without relaunching.
